link": null, "locked": false, "text": "消费者 B", "originalText": "消费者 B", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e46", "type": "text", "x": 1014, "y": 434, "width": 98.52000000000001, "height": 24.3, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 5198, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 33074, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "读取分区 1", "originalText": "读取分区 1", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e47", "type": "text", "x": 350, "y": 553, "width": 468, "height": 28.35, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 5311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 33793, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "每个分区内部按追加顺序读取；不同分区可以并行", "originalText": "每个分区内部按追加顺序读取；不同分区可以并行", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e48", "type": "text", "x": 35, "y": 600, "width": 615.45, "height": 22.950000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 5424, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 34512, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "同 Key 的路由示意，假设分区数与路由策略稳定；分区分配不是实际哈希结果。", "originalText": "同 Key 的路由示意，假设分区数与路由策略稳定；分区分配不是实际哈希结果。", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e49", "type": "text", "x": 35, "y": 628, "width": 590.9699999999999, "height": 22.950000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 5537, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 35231, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Topic 外框是逻辑归属，不是一台机器；图中仅画分区 Leader，省略副本。", "originalText": "Topic 外框是逻辑归属，不是一台机器；图中仅画分区 Leader，省略副本。", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}